      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cerebral. Quando Elgyem fica perto de uma televisão, paisagens estranhas aparecem na tela, e dizem que elas mostram seu lar. Este Pokémon foi descoberto há cerca de 50 anos e possui um cérebro altamente desenvolvido, capaz de gerar poderes psíquicos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Elgyem pode evoluir para Beheeyem no nível 14 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Heal Block</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Miracle Eye, Teleport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Hidden Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Simple Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Calm Mind, Guard Split, Power Split, Recover</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Synchronoise, Wonder Room</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Dark Pulse, Double Team, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Embargo, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Frustration, Gravity, Guard Swap, Hidden Power, Imprison, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Meteor Beam, Pain Split, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Screech, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Steel Wing, Substitute, Swagger, Telekinesis, Thief, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Wonder Room, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ally Switch, Astonish, Barrier, Cosmic Power, Destiny Bond, Disable, Guard Swap, Nasty Plot, Power Swap, Psych Up, Skill Swap, Teleport</p>",
